# shadcn/ui

This project uses [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) for all UI elements. Never use raw HTML elements or other component libraries when a shadcn/ui component exists for the use case.

## Initialization

If shadcn/ui is not yet set up in the project, run:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest init
```

## Adding Components

Before using a component, check whether it is already installed under `components/ui/`. If it is not, add it with:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>
```

Example — adding the Button component:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
```

## Usage

Import components from the local `components/ui/` path, not from an npm package:

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

// ❌ BAD
import { Button } from "shadcn-ui";
```
